    "longDescription": "Agentics isn't another chatbot. It's a business in a box.\n\nTalk to it. Ask it to build something. Watch it happen - live, on your screen, in real time. A game. A web app. A full website. Then deploy it to a live URL and start sharing it with the world. No coding required. No waiting. No middleman.\n\nWHAT MAKES AGENTICS DIFFERENT\n\nMost AI apps give you text. Agentics gives you products.\n\nWhen you ask Agentics to build an application, a game, or a website, it doesn't just describe what it would look like. It writes the entire thing in front of you - HTML, CSS, JavaScript - and renders a live preview as the code streams in. You see every change as it happens. When it's done, hit Deploy and your creation goes live on a real URL. You own it.\n\nVOICE-FIRST EXPERIENCE\n\nTap the microphone and speak naturally. Agentics listens, thinks, and responds with a voice that feels human. The voice orb reacts to both your speech and the AI's - a particle system that breathes with the conversation. While talking, you can ask it to build something and it will, right there in the voice session, without you ever touching the keyboard.",
